  "content_blocks": [
    {
      "block_id": "b00000",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Dynamic purchasing systems",
      "ordinal": 0,
      "heading_path": [
        "Dynamic purchasing systems"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "In: Procure > Clarification and due diligence",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [
        "Dynamic purchasing systems"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Overview",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [
        "Dynamic purchasing systems",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This regulation permits a contracting authority to use Dynamic Purchasing Systems (DPS) for commonly used purchases. The characteristics of the purchases (as generally available on the market) must meet the contracting authority’s requirements.",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [
        "Dynamic purchasing systems",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "A DPS must be operated completely electronically, including all communications. The DPS must be open to new suppliers to join at any time and, may be divided into categories. No charges may be billed to suppliers in respect of a DPS.",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [
        "Dynamic purchasing systems",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "The regulation also sets out the rules on how a contracting authority may establish a DPS and conduct procurements under them, including requirements around time limits and managing requests to participate.",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [
        "Dynamic purchasing systems",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Objective at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [
        "Dynamic purchasing systems",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Clarify and conduct due diligence on suppliers’ requests to participate in the DPS and any tenders submitted in procurements conducted under the system, in accordance with the principles of procurement.",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [
        "Dynamic purchasing systems",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Key considerations at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [
        "Dynamic purchasing systems",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Contracting authorities should:",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [
        "Dynamic purchasing systems",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "clarify and conduct due diligence on suppliers’ requests to participate in the DPS and any tenders submitted in procurements conducted under the system; in accordance with the principles of procurement.",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [
        "Dynamic purchasing systems",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
